  "releaseNotes": "Security improvements and validation enhancements:\n• XSS prevention in PaymentFormBuilder (HTML encoding for all user-controlled values)\n• Signature exception properties now internal (prevents information disclosure)\n• Exception messages sanitized (no raw response data in errors)\n• Proper URL construction for Regular API endpoints\n• Added domain validation methods (Card, Client, Product) with Luhn algorithm for card numbers\n• Added options validation at startup (IValidateOptions pattern)\n• Added certificate pinning support via ServerCertificateCustomValidationCallback\n• Improved webhook error handling with optional ILogger support\n• InvariantCulture for ReasonCode formatting (consistent signatures across cultures)",
